                <pb facs="0230" n="156" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg156"/>

                <head>[Extract from speech.]</head>
                <p>The civil war which has so long raged in the neighboring republic appears to be
                    drawing towards a close. The restoration of peace will no doubt be hailed by you
                    with a lively satisfaction, both as putting an end to the further effusion of
                    blood, and as re-opening to commerce channels which have since the commencement
                    of the war been closed.</p>
            </div>
